    "explanation": "The Dangerous Drugs Act of 2002 (R.A. 9165) outlines\npenalties for marijuana possession based on the quantity\ninvolved\nLife Imprisonment to Death:\n• Possession of 500 grams or more of marijuana.\n• Possession of 10 grams or more of marijuana resin or\nmarijuana resin oil.\nImprisonment of 20 years and 1 day to life imprisonment:\n• Possession of 300 grams or more but less than 500\ngrams of marijuana\nImprisonment of 12 years and 1 day to 20 years:\n• Possession of less than 300 grams of marijuana",
