    "correctChoice": "A",
    "explanation": "According to the PD 856, Sec. 90 of the Code of Sanitation, no\nburial ground shall be located within 50 meters from any\nsource of water supply.\nThe other requirements are as follows:\n• It shall be unlawful for any person to bury remains in\nplaces other than those legally authorized in\nconformity with the provisions\n• A burial ground shall at least be 25 meters distant from\nany dwelling house and no house shall be constructed\nwithin the same distance from any burial ground.\n• No burial ground shall be located within 50 meters\nfrom any source of water supply.",
