    "correctChoice": "C",
    "explanation": "Elements of medical malpractice consist of the following:\n• The physician has a duty to his patient.\n• The physician failed to perform such duty to his patient\n• As a consequence of the failure of the physician to\nperform his duty, injury was sustained by the patient\n• The failure of the physician to perform his duty is the\nproximate cause of injury sustained by the patient",
