    "id": "notion-legal-medicine-0011",
    "subject": "legal-medicine",
    "originalNumber": 11,
    "stem": "The following women have had sex with Don Juan. Who committed adultery? Adultery is committed by:",
    "choices": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "Angel, the girlfriend of Tim"
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "Gigi, the widow of Jojo"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "Jessie, the wife of Manny"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "Cora, annulled from Jackson"
      }
    ],
    "correctChoice": "C",
    "explanation": "Adultery is a legal and moral concept that typically involves a married person engaging in sexual relations with someone other than their spouse.\nJessie is identified as the wife of Manny. If Jessie engages in sexual relations with someone other than her spouse Manny, it would be considered adultery. In traditional legal and moral contexts, adultery is often defined as the act of a married person having sexual relations with someone other than their spouse.",
    "choiceRationales": {
      "A": "Angel is not married, as indicated by being Tim's girlfriend. Adultery, traditionally defined, involves a married person engaging in extramarital affairs. In this case, Angel is not married, so the act does not fall under the legal definition of adultery.",
      "B": "Gigi is a widow, which means her spouse (Jojo) has passed away. Adultery typically applies to situations where a married person engages in extramarital affairs. Since Jojo is deceased, Gigi is no longer married, and any relationship she has would not be considered adultery.",
      "C": "Adultery is a legal and moral concept that typically involves a married person engaging in sexual relations with someone other than their spouse.\nJessie is identified as the wife of Manny. If Jessie engages in sexual relations with someone other than her spouse Manny, it would be considered adultery. In traditional legal and moral contexts, adultery is often defined as the act of a married person having sexual relations with someone other than their spouse.",
      "D": "An annulment legally voids a marriage, and after annulment, the individuals are considered to have never been married. If Cora is annulled from Jackson, she is no longer legally married to him. Therefore, any subsequent relationship or sexual involvement would not be classified as adultery."
    },
