    "stem": "Dr. Bon was seen by his neighbor at the Hyatt\naccompanied by a woman other than his wife. The\nneighbor was appalled and decided to file a case against\nhim since the neighbor believes that his actions are a\ndisgrace to his profession. What level of evidence is\nneeded for this case?",
