    "stem": "A physician feels that his new patient is stubborn,\nuncooperative and difficult. On the other hand, the\npatient, who believes that he is juridically equal to his\ndoctor, sees his attending as unsympathetic and\narrogant. The psychological pattern of doctor-patient\nrelationship in this case is:",
