    "id": "superexam-legal-medicine-0430",
    "subject": "legal-medicine",
    "originalNumber": 430,
    "stem": "This refers to the post-mortem finding in which blood\nhas gravitated to the most dependent parts of the body\nbut still inside the the blood vessels in its fluid form:",
